Error [E0327]: This `..` is redundant
  --> pattern_value_tests_and_reactive_clones_use_runtime_capture_places.jet:14:43
    |
 14 |             { count: values.len(), label, .. } -> print(label)
    |                                           ^^
 Why: The pattern already names every field of `Incident`
 Fix: Remove `..` or leave out at least one field
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0327

Error [E0204]: `values` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> pattern_value_tests_and_reactive_clones_use_runtime_capture_places.jet:14:22
    |
 14 |             { count: values.len(), label, .. } -> print(label)
    |                      ^^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through the write-access marker `&`, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass the write-access marker `&` (`&values`) only once, or copy first with `~values`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
